DESCRIPTION:For about six weeks\, disciplined Saturn presses against your 
 Moon\, your emotional core\, while moving through your house of communicat
 ion and daily environment. This is a slow\, structural process: old emotio
 nal habits or reactions get tested by real responsibilities. It's not comf
 ortable\, but it's building resilience. Expect moments where you must choo
 se maturity over your first emotional impulse. → Notice one recurring fe
 eling and ask what responsibility would look like instead.\n\n— Technica
 l detail: Saturn within orb of square your Moon natal (house 6) · exact: 
 17/10/26\n\n(until Nov 10)\n\n—\n✨ A product created by Soul Friendly
