DESCRIPTION:Venus turns retrograde in your house of expansion and beliefs
 \, starting a six-week review of what you truly value in connection\, mean
 ing\, and growth. This is a natural pause\, not a loss. Avoid finalizing b
 ig commitments in love or spending on travel-related plans until Venus mov
 es forward again. Old themes or people from this life area may resurface f
 or closure. → What belief about love or worth are you ready to revisit?
 \n\n— Technical detail: Venus retrograde · 8°29' Scorpio · house 9 ·
